{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-01_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-01","title":"龍門之行","storyCode":"2-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"59935b8a4fb9f4a6fe9282ea7cf77817df989d6a4e86184b66d1e6be863a4666","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"龍門5區檢疫口，博士一行與龍門近衛局的陳會面。\n在陳的帶領下，幾人踏入龍門首腦魏彥吾的辦公室，而在那裡，談判已經開始。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:14 p.m. \\ 晴 \\ 能見度 19公里\n龍門5區外 檢疫口"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請注意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受天災影響，龍門全域處於停航狀態。龍門5區所有入城關口將於2小時後關閉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請積極配合工作人員進行礦石病檢疫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一旦發現任何未經登記的感染者，請廣大市民立刻向最近的警員通報，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局將依照《緊急處理法案》依法對其進行拘捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請注意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"和傳聞中一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島與近衛局約好在十點見面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是十點十四。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們遲到了十四分鐘，無謂地浪費了我十四分鐘時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，陳長官，這片區域剛才有整合————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道。不過這些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——這個人是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}是羅德島的顧問。凱爾希醫生應該通知過龍門的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，人已經到齊，現在你們需要跟我去見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官！不好了！不好——感染者——那又——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"慌什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一隊，戒備！狙擊隊員，就位！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發生，發生什麼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放開我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......怎麼回事，彙報情況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我過去！！為什麼要抓我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是怪物！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"有感染者——不服從管理——我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己都看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們全部拘押。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻疏散人群，半小時後通過複查流程後，再開放關口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，把檢疫口檢查線向前推四十米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的，除了你和Dr.{@nickname}，其他人不需要一起同行，留在這裡協助龍門邊防進行駐守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要是連這點小事都處理不好，無論是什麼任務，我可都沒法交給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"PC94172，你給這些人安排一下任務，今晚不要再出亂子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，陳警司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位，請注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（陳長官真的很嚴格......比我想像的要嚴格......）"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......（點頭）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。——"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好高的建築！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——羅德島的身手還算不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝陳長官誇獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格事件發生之後，什麼人都瘋了一樣地向龍門跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者就該清楚，來龍門會有什麼下場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我再提醒你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門就是下一個切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是凱爾希醫生......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們羅德島的代表已經和魏長官先行接觸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡等著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我一會兒通知你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那個陳警官，真的很難應付呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，接下來的交涉就交給凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信她吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["？？？","陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["？？？","近衛局隊員"]}]}
